{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00208",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 4.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Ready for you, doctor. I'll stay in case you need anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.74,
      "end_seconds": 7.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Okay, thank you. Right, hello, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.59,
      "end_seconds": 17.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Yeah, um, morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.88,
      "end_seconds": 27.06,
      "duration_seconds": 8.18,
      "text": "I'm here because of aching in my thighs. I just want to get back to normal, uh, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.54,
      "end_seconds": 31.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Alright, how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.73,
      "end_seconds": 42.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "Hmm, it's been going on for two weeks. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.4,
      "end_seconds": 53.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.68,
      "end_seconds": 57.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I, I'd say severe. It's worse with climbing stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.56,
      "end_seconds": 64.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 64.39,
      "end_seconds": 70.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, you know, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.34,
      "end_seconds": 84.29,
      "duration_seconds": 12.95,
      "text": "I was getting to that! Okay, um, so as for dark urine, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 84.97,
      "end_seconds": 87.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Mm, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.55,
      "end_seconds": 90.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Have you had any rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.27,
      "end_seconds": 93.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Yeah, no rash, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 95.02,
      "end_seconds": 99.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Um, actually, doctor, I did notice rash. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.09,
      "end_seconds": 106.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.73,
      "end_seconds": 115.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.96,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any joint swelling, numbness, recent heavy exercise or trouble swallowing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.04,
      "end_seconds": 129.32,
      "duration_seconds": 11.28,
      "text": "Hmm, no, no joint swelling, no numbness, no recent heavy exercise. I did have tiredness at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.61,
      "end_seconds": 133.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.1,
      "end_seconds": 138.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Okay, uh, so no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.09,
      "end_seconds": 142.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Okay, what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.22,
      "end_seconds": 146.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Right, you know, no, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 147.73,
      "end_seconds": 154.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. BP is 116 over 73, temperature is 36.8 degrees, pulse 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.35,
      "end_seconds": 158.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.27,
      "end_seconds": 163.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Just cataract surgery on my right eye, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.58,
      "end_seconds": 169.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.18,
      "end_seconds": 178.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "My brother has asthma. My father had a heart attack."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.57,
      "end_seconds": 181.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Right, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.69,
      "end_seconds": 185.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.78,
      "end_seconds": 186.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.23,
      "end_seconds": 191.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.65,
      "end_seconds": 197.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.58,
      "end_seconds": 201.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "No, you know, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.32,
      "end_seconds": 206.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.48,
      "end_seconds": 215.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "It's a... um, uh, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.4,
      "end_seconds": 218.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.98,
      "end_seconds": 231.63,
      "duration_seconds": 12.65,
      "text": "Um, for my pressure, I believe. My daughter sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I take rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 233.01,
      "end_seconds": 236.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.61,
      "end_seconds": 243.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Hm, that's different. Is the latest prescription anywhere near you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.15,
      "end_seconds": 254.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I mean, I take Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.14,
      "end_seconds": 259.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "So, do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.04,
      "end_seconds": 271.84,
      "duration_seconds": 10.8,
      "text": "Um, you know, I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.45,
      "end_seconds": 278.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.48,
      "end_seconds": 288.66,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had high blood pressure, yes. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.75,
      "end_seconds": 290.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Mm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.86,
      "end_seconds": 297.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "So, I have high cholesterol. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.46,
      "end_seconds": 299.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.9,
      "end_seconds": 302.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.37,
      "end_seconds": 312.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Go on. Right, so that's your known an underactive thyroid. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.44,
      "end_seconds": 316.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.08,
      "end_seconds": 320.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.86,
      "end_seconds": 333.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "The muscles are mildly tender when I squeeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.85,
      "end_seconds": 335.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.1,
      "end_seconds": 338.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.81,
      "end_seconds": 358.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Power in the thighs is slightly reduced, four out of five."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.37,
      "end_seconds": 392.49,
      "duration_seconds": 29.12,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with muscle symptoms that may be related to the cholesterol tablet. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out a vitamin D deficiency yet. I'd also keep an underactive thyroid in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.11,
      "end_seconds": 399.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Yeah, I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.54,
      "end_seconds": 417.87,
      "duration_seconds": 18.33,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now muscle symptoms that may be related to the cholesterol tablet is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'd like to arrange a thyroid test for muscle weakness. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 419.33,
      "end_seconds": 420.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 422.22,
      "end_seconds": 445.82,
      "duration_seconds": 23.6,
      "text": "I'm going to order a creatine kinase level, for muscle pain. Don't stop any of your tablets on your own, we'll decide after the blood test. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 446.85,
      "end_seconds": 448.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 449.25,
      "end_seconds": 455.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 456.7,
      "end_seconds": 459.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Right, um, got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 461.42,
      "end_seconds": 469.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.21,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the results are back. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 470.37,
      "end_seconds": 474.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Uh, that's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 475.23,
      "end_seconds": 475.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}